%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-06 §"Topic Preference Decay" (no sequenceDiagram in spec for the cron flow).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DecayScheduler
    participant DecayWorker
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over DecayScheduler: weekly Sunday 03:00 UTC
    DecayScheduler-)DecayWorker: tick — cp-topic-decay
    alt postgres_unavailable
        DecayWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE topic_preferences SET interaction_count = count/2 WHERE last_interaction_at < now-30d AND count >= 2
        PostgreSQL--xDecayWorker: connection error
        Note over DecayWorker: emit decay_failure metric, retry next week
    else partial_batch_failure_resume_next_week
        DecayWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE topic_preferences SET interaction_count = count/2 WHERE last_interaction_at < now-30d AND count >= 2
        PostgreSQL-->>DecayWorker: rowcount=N (partial)
        DecayWorker->>PostgreSQL: DELETE FROM topic_preferences WHERE last_interaction_at < now-30d AND interaction_count < 1
        PostgreSQL--xDecayWorker: error mid-batch
        Note over DecayWorker: log partial — idempotent rerun next Sunday picks up remainder
    else success
        DecayWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE topic_preferences SET interaction_count = count/2 WHERE last_interaction_at < now-30d AND count >= 2
        PostgreSQL-->>DecayWorker: OK rowcount=halved
        DecayWorker->>PostgreSQL: DELETE FROM topic_preferences WHERE last_interaction_at < now-30d AND interaction_count < 1
        PostgreSQL-->>DecayWorker: OK rowcount=deleted
        DecayWorker-)DecayWorker: log {halved, deleted}
    end
    Note over DecayScheduler,PostgreSQL: halves counts for stale topics — deletes when count drops below 1
